<title>HUNGARY: IBUSZ WIDENS OP LOSS IN Q1, HAS PRE-TAX LOSS.</title>
<headline>IBUSZ WIDENS OP LOSS IN Q1, HAS PRE-TAX LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-March 1997  Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result	 73.7 loss   vs   10.5 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax results	  66.7 loss   vs   22.9 profit</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 518.2	  vs  534.1</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    11.7	  vs   59.6</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	 288.6	  vs  322.1</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	176.5	  vs  147.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation		     21.0	  vs   18.3</p>
<p>    Other costs			95.5	  vs   98.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     22.0	  vs   17.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    5.8 profit vs   33.4 profit</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	1.1 profit vs    0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Ibusz Rt is a tourism services group.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated</p>
<p>in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
